# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in real values. Restart the dev server after
# changing any of these — Next.js only reads env vars at start-up.

# ---------- Web3Forms (Enquire-form delivery) ----------
# Sign up: https://web3forms.com — free tier is 250 submissions / month.
# 1. Enter your inbox email (e.g. sales@addonwebsolutions.com) on the homepage.
# 2. Web3Forms emails you an "access key" (a UUID). Paste it here.
# 3. The key is public — it ships to the browser, which is fine: Web3Forms
#    only delivers to the email that originally registered the key.
# When unset, the front-end shows an error asking the visitor to email instead.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
